# cardano-data-layer — OHLCV history collector.
# Runs the poller in single-shot mode every 5 minutes. This is the "history
# clock": it persists a price tick per tracked token so OHLCV candles can be
# aggregated on read. The collected history is unrecoverable if not started now,
# so this should run continuously from as early as possible.
#
# Install (preserves any existing crontab):
#   ( crontab -l 2>/dev/null; cat deploy/poller.crontab ) | crontab -
# Inspect: crontab -l   |   Logs: service/data/poller.log
#
# Tracked tokens default to the built-in seed set (MIN, SNEK, HOSKY); set
# CDL_POLL_UNITS in the environment to track more.
*/5 * * * * cd /home/midnight/cardano-data-layer/service && /usr/bin/node --disable-warning=ExperimentalWarning src/jobs/ohlcv-poller.js --once >> /home/midnight/cardano-data-layer/service/data/poller.log 2>&1
